><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Gigantic_Endurance\"> Condition: Gigantic Endurance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gigantic_Endurance_(Condition)\" title=\"Gigantic Endurance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gigantic Endurance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gigantic_Endurance_(Condition)\" title=\"Gigantic Endurance (Condition)\">Gigantic Endurance</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_